{"overview":"وقتی یک دزد افسانه‌ای چشم‌اش را به مونالیزا می‌دوزد، دو غریبهٔ جوان را برای کمک به خود جذب می‌کند و سپس فاش می‌کند که آن‌ها برادر و خواهر گمشده‌اش هستند… و بله، او پدرشان است. این خانوادهٔ تازه تشکیل‌شده که به‌طور ناخواسته در یک دیدار پرآشوب گرفتار شده‌اند، باید یاد بگیرند با هم کار کنند — و سعی کنند یکدیگر را نکُشند — اگر می‌خواهند شانس انجام بزرگ‌ترین سرقت قرن را داشته باشند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When a legendary thief sets his sights on the Mona Lisa, he recruits two young strangers to help him before revealing they are long-lost siblings… and oh yes, by the way, he is their father. Thrown into a chaotic reunion they never asked for, this new family must learn to work together — and try not to kill each other — if they want any chance at pulling off the heist of the century.","tagline_en":"","runtime":110,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Thomas Vincent"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR","US"],"cast":[{"name":"استنلی توچی","role":"Roger","photo":"/q4TanMDI5Rgsvw4SfyNbPBh4URr.jpg","en":"Stanley Tucci"},{"name":"Simona Tabasco","role":"Chiara","photo":"/eHH3kzBwc69E9BvDRCtOEtY1CSc.jpg"},{"name":"Victor Belmondo","role":"Jay","photo":"/sO3BOoXM8UseOJr7Ba0q0jgGbRV.jpg"},{"name":"مارک ایوانیر","role":"Bruno","photo":"/1kxGAsP4YRiR7LgmlM9KgtekMLk.jpg","en":"Mark Ivanir"},{"name":"Philippe Uchan","role":"Bartoli","photo":"/sBfrwOm7wgJgitDdhLX6zHPYKR1.jpg"},{"name":"Foëd Amara","role":"Mo","photo":"/vQRiS6bnYnwEsYFPXKBoqHGAbVM.jpg"},{"name":"Élisabeth Vitali","role":"Jay's Mother","photo":"/2hydpVewqqe3fxbubCMm365gYVV.jpg"},{"name":"Jonas Bachan","role":"Benjy","photo":"/nbEtdd3ynDIzLNDYSUTx4cBqTPu.jpg"},{"name":"Eliott Margueron","role":"Control Operator #2","photo":"/bXXHdRf9NBXHlA0OBlROZgolaMp.jpg"},{"name":"Ike Zacsongo-Joseph","role":"Control Operator #3","photo":"/436HoOgbA6ucGgc3MRhzdIio06X.jpg"},{"name":"Nicolas Phongpheth","role":"Control Operator #4","photo":"/r2p1iTwRYHSPB0e6VUow96CKR3i.jpg"},{"name":"Livio Pacella","